    "title": "Tandem Foods Expands Allegheny County, Pennsylvania, Production Operations - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Area Development News Desk ,\n21 hours ago Food manufacturer Tandem Foods plans to expand its operations in O’Hara Township, Pennsylvania. The $42 million project is expected to create 83 jobs in Allegheny County. The investment will include the lease of an additional 79,000 square feet at the company’s existing facility and the installation of a new food production line dedicated to cold-form bar manufacturing. Read full article",
